      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "There were presented several aspects of epidemiology, diagnosis and therapy in infants with recurrent bronchial obturation (wheezing). It was emphasized the crucial role of medical history and some laboratory tests. Pharmacological and non-pharmacological methods of early intervention in wheezing neonates were also discussed."},
